OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, falls from double decker
OL,4,Abus window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has fallen out of the
OL,7,Fwindow of a double-decker bus.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,10,Fcalled at about 15:50 BST to the
OL,11,Fincident in Doddington Road,
OL,12,FWimblington.
OL,14,FIt added that the boy's injuries were
OL,15,F"unclear at this stage" and did not
OL,16,Fspecify which level of the bus the boy
OL,17,Freportedly fell from.
OL,19,FAn East of England Ambulance Service
OL,20,Fspokesperson said the boy was
OL,21,Ftransported by road to Peterborough
OL,22,FCity Hospital for further treatment.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
